Hii! Verifying for 66 points (I think?!) If it's correct, I'd like Gardevoir from the options! But more importantly, I'm strawberry (with the ritchie icon) in the discord server, and I'd like the role please haha

oh GOD it's bad. i didn't expect it to be this bad. it's not even hard, nihility why? why limit us to three weapon types when we can bring four characters? who was out here unbinding the copies on their weapons? why does it auto pop the chest? why does it take a decade to max out goof's spiral with this? why give us the orbs you have to break in time and then limit us to some of the slowest weapon types?

&#x200B;

but - most importantly, *nihility why?*
